1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,583
The Car Trip by Ruth Donnelly we are going  on a trip
露丝·唐纳利的汽车旅行我们要去旅行

2
00:00:02,584 --> 00:00:03,423
Not on a plane!
不是在飞机上！

3
00:00:03,423 --> 00:00:04,343
Not in a ship!
不是在船上！

4
00:00:04,344 --> 00:00:05,835
We will ride in our new car
我们将乘坐我们的新车

5
00:00:05,944 --> 00:00:07,835
Buckle up -- we will go far
系好安全带我们会走得更远

6
00:00:08,063 --> 00:00:09,304
Red light stop
红灯停止

7
00:00:09,304 --> 00:00:10,462
Green light, go
绿灯，走

8
00:00:10,464 --> 00:00:12,743
Yellow light means slow, slow slow
黄灯表示慢，慢，慢

9
00:00:12,743 --> 00:00:14,435
Baby brother starts to fret
小弟弟开始烦恼

10
00:00:14,624 --> 00:00:16,015
Sister says,"Are we there yet?
姐姐说：“我们到了吗？

11
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:16,184
"
"

12
00:00:16,184 --> 00:00:16,984
Quite now
相当现在

13
00:00:16,984 --> 00:00:17,743
Don't make a peep
别偷看

14
00:00:17,743 --> 00:00:19,343
Baby brother's  fast asleep
小弟弟睡着了

15
00:00:19,344 --> 00:00:20,702
I'm as quite as a mouse ...
我像老鼠一样安静…

16
00:00:20,704 --> 00:00:22,722
And here we are --at Grandma's house！
我们到了——在奶奶家！

